<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S9.T11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="S9.T11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Token reduction strategy ablation for ResidualViT.<span id="S9.T11.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We ablate four different token reduction strategies on the Charades-STA dataset. For all, we fix the token reduction probability to <math id="S9.T11.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="85\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mo mathsize="1.110em">%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">85\%</annotation></semantics></math>. Memory cost is normalized according to the baseline memory footprint.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
