<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S12.F18.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S12.F18.sf2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Grounding example.<span id="S12.F18.sf2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Our prediction does not overlap with the ground truth moment.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
